 <h3><u>Rona na sakina</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haaye sakina..(4)<br> Shabe ashoor choti shehzadi se kehte the husain<br> meri jaan sakina..<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>amma hi ki aaghosh me sojana sakina<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Allah kisi beti ko dikhlaye na wo ghum<br> jo ghum tumhe khud deke chale jaenge kal hum<br> kal tumko na mil payega ye baba ka seena<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Ye baat ghanimat hai tere waste beta<br> seene pe mere chayn se soja meri dukhiya<br> kal khaak me mil jaega zehra ka nagina<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Ek baat mai samjhata hu ae beti abhi se<br> shikwa nahi karna kabhi amma se, phuphi se<br> sone ke liye raat ko zidd karna kabhi na<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Kehte hai jise daaghe yatimi meri dukhiya<br> kal sar pe tere baap ka saaya na rahega<br> ye ehle sitam tujhe ab dikhlaege keena<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Mangunga dua mai teri khatir ye khuda se<br> mehfooz rakhe wo tujhe har ranjo bala se<br> raas aaye safar, aaye safar ka ye mehina<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Jo dard tujhe denge laee mai bhi sahunga<br> tum naaqe pe aur barsare naiza mai chalunga<br> waada hai akela tumhe chodunga kabhi na<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Hojayegi tu qaid teri aaho buka bhi<br> madar bhi teri, phuphiya bhi aur zainul eba bhi<br> tumko usi zindaan me sona hai sakina<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Ae mazhar o irfan qayamat hai y e jumle<br> maa baap sada saath nahi rehte kisi ke<br> sheh kehte the ab seekh lo bin baap ke jeena<br> tum baad mere dekho yu rona na sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>haaye sakina haaye sakina.</p> 
